 <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1121927762"><p><br/></p><p class="size-18 m-size-14"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-14" style="display: initial;">2021</span></p><p><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-14" style="display: initial;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="size-18 m-size-14"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-14" style="display: initial;">2,5 months of fieldwork on Soviet heritage in agriculture, cropping changes and irrigation water issues in Southeastern Kazakhstan</span></p><p><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-14" style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="size-18 m-size-14"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-14" style="display: initial;">2019</span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">1 month of explorative fieldwork on post-Soviet agricultural transformations in Panfilov District, Almaty Region, Kazakhstan</span></p><p><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">2018</span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">1 month on interactions between Chinese industrial fisheries and local artisanal fisheries in Senegal, Mauritania and Ghana (PADDLE)</span></p><p><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">2018</span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">1 month on climate change-induced mobilities/migration in mariculture/scallop farming along the Peruvian Pacific (Core Funding)</span></p><p><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">2011-2014</span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">6 months on transformed mobility and exchange processes in crossborder trade between China and Central Asia (Almaty and Zharkent, Kazakhstan/Bishkek, Kyrgyzstan/Guangzhou, China)</span></p><p><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">2006-2009</span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">12 months on the migration and integration processes of Kazakhs from Mongolia (Almaty and Astana, Kazakhstan/Bayan-Ulgiy, Mongolia)</span></p><p><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">2002</span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">2 months on the Georgian-Abkhaz reconciliation process (Georgia)</span></p><p><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p></div> 
