 <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1210220304"><p><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">Peer-reviewed Journals</span></p><p><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="m-font-size-13 font-size-18" style="display: initial;">Alff, H., &amp; Spies, M. (2020). &bdquo;Pfadabh&auml;ngigkeiten in der Bio&ouml;konomie &uuml;berwinden? Landwirtschaftliche Intensivierungsprozesse aus sozial-&ouml;kologischer Perspektive.&ldquo; PERIPHERIE 159/160, 334-359. <br/></span><a href="https://doi.org/10.3224/peripherie.v40i3-4.06" runtime_url="https://doi.org/10.3224/peripherie.v40i3-4.06" type="url" class="m-font-size-14 font-size-18" style="display: initial;">https://doi.org/</a><a href="https://doi.org/10.3224/peripherie.v40i3-4.06" runtime_url="https://doi.org/10.3224/peripherie.v40i3-4.06" type="url" class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">10.3224/peripherie.v40i3-4.06</a></p><p><span style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">Alff, Henryk (2020): &quot;Negotiating coastal infrastructures: An evolutionary governance theory (EGT) approach to Chinese high-modernist development along the Indian Ocean.&quot; In: Marine Policy 112, February 2020, 103545.</span></p><p><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;"><br/></span></p><p class="m-size-13 size-18"><span class="font-size-18 m-font-size-13" style="display: initial;">Morales-Mu&ntilde;oz, H&eacute;ctor; Jha, Srijna; Bonatti, Michelle; Alff, Henryk; Kurtenbach, Sabine and Sieber, Stefan (2020): &quot;Exploring Connections&mdash;Environmental Change, Food Security and Violence as Drivers of Migration. A Critical Review of Research.&quot; In: Sustainability. July 2020.</span><span single-space="true